      "bio_summary": {
        "value": "David Bokash was born in Northwest Indiana becoming a fifth generation Hoosier. He attended elementary school in Hobart where his mother's family had a small farm and helped establish Augustana Lutheran Church. Young David spent summers working the family farm with his grandfather, Walter Isakson, who received a Hoosier Homestead Award from Governor Otis Bowen in the 1970s for having a family farm for more than 100 years.",
